flowchart LR
    Client["MCP client<br/>(Claude Desktop or other MCP-compatible client)"]
    Tools["lab_archives_mcp FastMCP server tools<br/>discovery | reading | search/index | project graph | write & provenance"]
    API["LabArchives API<br/>HMAC-signed notebook, page, entry, and upload calls"]
    State["Local project state<br/>~/.labarchives_state/session_state.json<br/>NetworkX graph"]
    Embed["Embedding provider<br/>OpenAI text-embedding-3-small by default"]
    Vector["Vector backend<br/>Pinecone vectors + metadata<br/>local Parquet chunk persistence"]

    Client <--> Tools
    Tools <--> API
    Tools <--> State
    API -->|"page and entry text for indexing"| Tools
    Tools -->|"chunk text"| Embed
    Embed -->|"embedding vectors"| Tools
    Tools -->|"vectors, chunk text, metadata"| Vector
    Vector -->|"ranked page matches"| Tools
